{
	"name": "Celestial Moth",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/creatures/invertebrates/bee-simple-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Beautiful ivory, gold, and green, these large moths are believed to originate from the Upper Planes. Characterized by their feather-like wings and shimmering glow, they are often encountered in or near holy sites when found on the Material Plane. They are considered to be symbols of peace, and among many cultures it is considered an egregious sin to harm them. Those who spend at least 10 minutes near a celestial moth experience the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.hnvt4tnuww6o4vvi]{Calm Emotions} spell as the moth’s natural peacefulness extends to them.</p>",
